            {
              "itemId": "1993",
              "name": "Kay",
              "lang": "en",
              "brief": {
                "cover": "https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20261125/5377252742477/6b0667d5a03f3aa857d2b20a_56331367.png",
                "name": "Kay",
                "description": null,
                "associate": {
                  "id": "4bd6b9cffb427b24a3adf5767197a8c4",
                  "name": "小刻",
                  "type": "char",
                  "dotType": "label_type_up"
                },
                "dotType": "label_type_up",
                "subTypeList": [
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10000",
                    "value": "10006"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10100",
                    "value": "10104"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10200",
                    "value": "10204"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10213",
                    "value": "10216"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10219",
                    "value": "10223"
                  }
                ],
                "composite": null,
                "disableCoverShowInDetail": false,
                "redirectLink": "",
                "redirectLinkMobile": ""
              },
              "status": 2,
              "tagIds": [
                "10006",
                "10204",
                "10104",
                "10216",
                "10223"
              ],
              "publishedAtTs": "1795273395",
              "caption": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "\"All the way from there to here... Whoa, I've come so far and taken down so many bad guys!\"\n\nYoung in age and hearty in appetite, Kay left Rhodes Island to embark on her journey, determined to explore every inch of Talos-II, driven by one simple wish: to find Endfield and the Endministrator. Before she knew it, her footprints could be found in every corner of this planet, and she had made friends along every memorable stretch of her journey.\n\nEven now, skilled as she is with her backpack stuffed full, Kay remains curious about the world around her, and the stories of Endfield and the Endministrator have inspired a new dream in her. As for how to make that dream come true, Kay has had an idea for some time—\n\n\"Chill this, sizzle that. All you need is a little boom, bam, pow! Annnd done! I've always kept things super easy peasy.\""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "itemId": "1994",
              "name": "Mimino",
              "lang": "en",
              "brief": {
                "cover": "https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20261121/6743194780021/6b01ab77a03f3aa857d2a71b_2f76db19.png",
                "name": "Mimino",
                "description": null,
                "associate": null,
                "dotType": "label_type_preview",
                "subTypeList": [
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10000",
                    "value": "10005"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10100",
                    "value": "10105"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10200",
                    "value": "10206"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10213",
                    "value": "10215"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10219",
                    "value": "10220"
                  }
                ],
                "composite": null,
                "disableCoverShowInDetail": false,
                "redirectLink": "",
                "redirectLinkMobile": ""
              },
              "status": 2,
              "tagIds": [
                "10005",
                "10206",
                "10105",
                "10215",
                "10220"
              ],
              "publishedAtTs": "1795272494",
              "caption": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "\"Did someone call for heavy artillery?! Ah... Okay. Maybe I misheard it.\""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "Mimino was born in Valley IV and grew up listening to stories about the Endministrator. She later moved to Simonch with her parents, where she became a top student with excellent grades and conduct. She soon joined the Workers' Guards and became one of their youngest elites."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "Although Mimino was not selected during her practical training before heading to the Northern Front, she did not give up on herself. Instead, she proactively requested to return to Valley IV to participate in and assist with the internship work at Endfield. Mimino is a warrior and activity organizer with great potential. As long as everyone can tolerate her simple, somewhat stubborn personality and her overly serious approach to doing things, she will be a good companion. "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "Though she's still young and has yet to accomplish anything truly great, she knows that one day, history will turn into a legend, and all she hopes is to carve her name into its pages — for those who did not survive and for those who long to survive. "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "\"Mat' Gorodov, I have taken another step to completing your grand enterprise!\""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "itemId": "1279",
              "name": "Argent Flow",
              "lang": "en",
              "brief": {
                "cover": "https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20261107/3864465401225/6aee7613a03f3aa857d27137_3eac6ad0.png",
                "name": "Argent Flow",
                "description": null,
                "associate": {
                  "id": "0e691c08a09d81bc7f8fa14a1cb03561",
                  "name": "明河",
                  "type": "char",
                  "dotType": ""
                },
                "dotType": "",
                "subTypeList": [
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10000",
                    "value": "10006"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10100",
                    "value": "10102"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10200",
                    "value": "10201"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10213",
                    "value": "10217"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10219",
                    "value": "10222"
                  }
                ],
                "composite": null,
                "disableCoverShowInDetail": false,
                "redirectLink": "",
                "redirectLinkMobile": ""
              },
              "status": 2,
              "tagIds": [
                "10006",
                "10201",
                "10102",
                "10217",
                "10222"
              ],
              "publishedAtTs": "1791369445",
              "caption": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "\"Suited up and ready. There will be no holding back.\""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "Argent Flow, Imperial Guard of Yan and Captain of Pacified Skies of Hongshan Academy of Sciences. With sword in hand, he spurs his galloper, Nuli, forward like a bolt of lightning across the northern front lines, leaving countless legends in his wake. Yet beyond the legends, he is not"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "nearly as aloof as people make him out to be. As he journeys across mountains and rivers, he never hesitates to lend a hand whenever he encounters someone in need, no matter how small the matter."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "He rarely speaks of the past, yet old tales still linger on people's lips: it was you who changed how he wields his sword."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "Body of steel, heart of soul. The answer you gave him has illuminated his path through the long night. From here on, he will continue to serve"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "under Tianshi Tan and journey across Talos-II to solve whatever disasters may arise. Sword in hand, he will walk alongside Endfield and carve a path for civilization, until the lights of every home can shine undisturbed by calamity."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "\"When you need to make a hard decision, I will be at your side. You can have full faith in our bond.\""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "itemId": "1278",
              "name": "Si",
              "lang": "en",
              "brief": {
                "cover": "https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20261015/6743194780021/6ad0b82cbe8f5e2663681b9f_db193eac.png",
                "name": "Si",
                "description": null,
                "associate": {
                  "id": "38bc410d7e134743ed8ee881d8400833",
                  "name": "祀",
                  "type": "char",
                  "dotType": ""
                },
                "dotType": "",
                "subTypeList": [
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10000",
                    "value": "10006"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10100",
                    "value": "10103"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10200",
                    "value": "10206"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10213",
                    "value": "10214"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10219",
                    "value": "10222"
                  }
                ],
                "composite": null,
                "disableCoverShowInDetail": false,
                "redirectLink": "",
                "redirectLinkMobile": ""
              },
              "status": 2,
              "tagIds": [
                "10006",
                "10206",
                "10103",
                "10214",
                "10222"
              ],
              "publishedAtTs": "1791369442",
              "caption": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "\"Hmph. Only think of me when trouble shows up?\"\r"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "Si is one of the few Feranmut Proxies on Talos-II. The Feranmuts are paracausal beings native to Terra, and the consciousness that They manifest in slumber before human presence is known as Feranmut Proxy.\r"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "Si's relationship with her Feranmut is somewhat complicated, but people still habitually refer to her as a Feranmut Proxy. In truth, Si is no one's Proxy. She is simply herself. Beneath her formidable and mysterious exterior lies a young soul who still holds onto hope and curiosity about the world.\r"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "In her daily life, she uses her abilities to provide comprehensive support for HAS and Endfield. In her spare time, she enjoys exploring the cities of Talos-II in search of the latest technologies and fashion trends. She follows her heart's desires and is unfettered by conventions.\r"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "\"I'll help you out again. Remember to pay up once we get back to the inn.\""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "itemId": "1174",
              "name": "Purrchena",
              "lang": "en",
              "brief": {
                "cover": "https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260924/7192618399447/6ab4b6e0a03f3aa857d194d2_3eac6ad0.png",
                "name": "Purrchena",
                "description": null,
                "associate": {
                  "id": "785633c59ed6665c0cf4a3fda3c66f2d",
                  "name": "噗切娜",
                  "type": "char",
                  "dotType": ""
                },
                "dotType": "",
                "subTypeList": [
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10000",
                    "value": "10005"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10100",
                    "value": "10105"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10200",
                    "value": "10205"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10213",
                    "value": "10217"
                  },
                  {
                    "subTypeId": "10219",
                    "value": "10224"
                  }
                ],
                "composite": null,
                "disableCoverShowInDetail": false,
                "redirectLink": "",
                "redirectLinkMobile": ""
              },
              "status": 2,
              "tagIds": [
                "10005",
                "10205",
                "10105",
                "10217",
                "10224"
              ],
              "publishedAtTs": "1787362952",
              "caption": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "\"My turn to ... 'Meow-dy!' ...Ugh, how am I asleep again?!\" "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "Purrchena is a big fan of desserts and serves as the spokesperson for the Ætherside Environmental Impact Syndrome Relief Foundation. She joined the Business Office of Endfield Industries at the recommendation of the Talos-II General Chamber of Commerce (TGCC) and has since become the liaison between Endfield and TGCC in the field of Ætherside Syndrome."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "When Purrchena first stepped into the public eye, the love and care people showed her made her aware of the responsibility she carried. But after she became the Foundation's spokesperson and stood alongside those living with Ætherside Syndrome, she realized how little she could do. Even though Ætherside Syndrome often caused her to fall asleep without warning, every time she woke up, she would set out again, carrying everyone's love with her. In her own way, Purrchena keeps the other patients receiving help smiling."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": "\"Got my marshmallows and exotic dried fin... Alright, I'm good to go!\""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": {
                    "text": " "
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
